{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/6b92ae847f5326a9d81104351ff4e315.webp?t=1772912475\" width=650 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Inspired by PlateUp and Stacklands, Cater Co. is a cozy kitchen management game where you make food and fulfill your customers' orders. Sit back, earn $$$, buy upgrades and streamline your kitchen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/68f719c3e4e6e6128615e8b31f1278ff.poster.avif?t=1772912475\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/68f719c3e4e6e6128615e8b31f1278ff.webm?t=1772912475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/68f719c3e4e6e6128615e8b31f1278ff.mp4?t=1772912475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow your catering business and learn more about the lives of your returning customers. There are over 100+ recipes to discover, each building upon each-other, and automate your kitchen to streamline production.\u00a0Everything is at your own pace. There are no timers. Take your time designing your kitchen, experimenting with automation, and exploring recipes. Earn money to unlock upgrades and expand your catering business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/11563fd59f887f1943c575a41f1e32f0.webp?t=1772912475\" width=650 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will be encountering many returning customers and learn about their lives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover their wholesome stories through your fulfilling their catering orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/b518ed42f4ff3461a8cc7788b655b144.avif?t=1772912475\" width=609 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/35a44b7824934f1b66eec54ca8f7d4b2.webp?t=1772912475\" width=650 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/1039e1c0d2112cbacdcdf5c99d4b049e.avif?t=1772912475\" width=609 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/4d74541be819eb218eb9ef6997bfeddf.webp?t=1772912475\" width=650 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FAQ: What is the cat for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He's just a good looking cat :3\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934